    "own_line": true,
    "norm": "Tests {@link FileTimes#ntfsTimeToDate(long)}. <p> An NTFS time is the number of 100-nanosecond intervals elapsed since the NTFS epoch (1601-01-01T00:00:00Z). Each test case pairs an NTFS time value with the UTC instant it should map to. The conversion is verified at millisecond precision, since {@link java.util.Date} only retains milliseconds. </p>"
